# from the harness directory; scripts/tfvars_check.py follows that segment and parses every
# `python -m seq2causebench.<cmd>` line below with the real parsers. One discover call per
# (grain, probe, noise, frozen c, N, g) group of the freeze (9 reads: the core information-gain
# and CMI cells of one layout share a read where they froze at one c; the keep probe reads both
# keep arms; the atomic arm's two paths are two reads, each with both cuts); every call names
